448 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/T (- Normal RSA signing: signature = message^d mod N \(requires private key d\) - Verification: message = signature^e mod N - With e=3 and careful padding, we can find signature values without knowing d)
/E (- Normal RSA signing: signature = message^d mod N \(requires private key d\) - Verification: message = signature^e mod N - With e=3 and careful padding, we can find signature values without knowing d)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [10]
>>
