/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/T (The server's padding removal \(split\(b'\\x00'\)[-1]\) allows us to prepend arbitrary bytes before a null byte separator. This means we can construct [arbitrary bytes] + \\x00 + b'VOTE FOR PEDRO' When this is the result of vote^3, the server accepts it as valid.)
/E (The server's padding removal \(split\(b'\\x00'\)[-1]\) allows us to prepend arbitrary bytes before a null byte separator. This means we can construct [arbitrary bytes] + \\x00 + b'VOTE FOR PEDRO' When this is the result of vote^3, the server accepts it as valid.)
