/E (1. Use larger public exponents \(minimum e=65537\) 2. Implement PKCS#1 v2.0 \(PSS\) for signatures 3. Use OAEP padding for encryption 4. Ensure messages are always close to modulus size 5. Follow cryptographic standards and best practices)
